# Symlinks are never committed to this repository.
#
# All of these point outside the repo and resolve only on the popgen server,
# so committing them would give anyone cloning a dangling link.
#
# Git has no pattern for "ignore every symlink", so each one is listed here.
# If you add a new symlink to the repo root, add it to this file too.
# To check that none are tracked:
#     git ls-files -s | awk '$1=="120000"'

# the shared data store            data       -> /course/data/
/data

# notes for AI agents               agentGuide -> /course/agentGuide/
/agentGuide

# the BSA workgroup share           BSA/BSA    -> /davidData/data/BSA/
/BSA/BSA
